{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "72243106cf6e11590b9419809a77ed52e0ac8c49d9ab01858ef8df16a18acc54", "ja": "どこか、遠くまで", "zh": "去往某处的远方", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "fdd556de875e3530a02eae1393b52a9d2b0fe0bb65d8b6677f0447b7e0867739", "ja": "カラオケで盛り上がるジュリアと恵美。プロ\nデューサーにも強引にマイクを渡し、3人で\n思い切り歌う。すっかりリフレッシュできた\nプロデューサーは、このまま逃げちゃう？\nと誘うふたりに首を振り、仕事に戻る。", "zh": "在卡拉OK兴高采烈的茱莉亚和惠美。把麦克\n风硬塞给制作人，3个人痛痛快快地\n唱了一番。彻底放松下来的制作人，\n对邀请他“要不要就这样逃走？”的两人\n摇了摇头，回到了工作中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "64b8a16120e986ab827a17bcf87cd64a4cb3546bdde9c010413ce3a340cb6cf3", "ja": "（ジュリアと恵美にさらわれて、あちこち\n連れ回されている……今は、カラオケにやってきた）", "zh": "（被茱莉亚和惠美拐来拐去……现在到了卡拉OK）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "5b4c02c4b4b50b2f78b8b43a5a4ff7f68f997df4c6bed5d35c90234534929d9c", "ja": "……はぁ！？　おいおい、98点って\nどういうことだよ。自分の持ち歌なのに……くぅ。", "zh": "……哈啊！？喂喂，98分\n是怎么回事啊。明明唱的是自己的歌……可恶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_1002_020meg", "source_sha256": "5f8067458b5c58204307b5a5056f7f4b2b4f605feeb43bb5d58dd87b6bfb3461", "ja": "にゃはは♪　あるある。\nでもジュリアって、ホント歌うまいよね～！", "zh": "呀哈哈♪ 这种事很常见嘛。\n不过，茱莉亚真的很会唱歌呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "b1c0e791a13c475ef81c917f6d05d6c998e6d9ec624dc3ad0c526c29aa6ad0b8", "ja": "点数、もうちょっとで勝てないんだよな～。\n消費カロリーなら負けてないんだけど。", "zh": "分数总是差一点赢不了啊～\n不过要比消耗的卡路里，我可没输。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "ccc9daf26137e97428492312d0517dc46cf9fa6e0e4d5de63372ca0923e80ce0", "ja": "いや、恵美だって、すげえいい声してるよ。\n正確なだけがいい歌ってワケじゃないし。", "zh": "不，惠美的嗓音也非常棒啊。\n好歌又不只是唱得准。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_1005_p", "source_sha256": "501501ba157e23aea492be818b0c5d391d1c9306c0a477bb08236f7d8934e107", "ja": "そうそう。カラオケの採点は、\nゲームみたいなものだと思えばいいよ。", "zh": "对对。把卡拉OK评分当成游戏就好啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "3539a8b438e06d33e736c973825c04043d2f7a2b06f2fa5911ec8ba26b5ba107", "ja": "だな！　……で、{$P$}？\nそろそろあんたも入れろよな。", "zh": "对吧！……那么，{$P$}？\n你也差不多该点一首了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_1007_p", "source_sha256": "de1f07acbe22308d3891d8fb4b0c659effd79f5560d57bd06ee1deea0426629a", "ja": "えっ！？　いやいやいや！\n無理だよ、ふたりの前で歌ったりとか……！", "zh": "诶！？不不不！\n不行啊，要我在你们两个人面前唱歌什么的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "df27aa1828508e5905e94d0ca5dba5d9b14a860cd6b035516f3bd64a754f3a80", "ja": "ゲームみたいなもんだろ♪\nほら恵美、勝手に入れちゃえ！　知ってそうなヤツ。", "zh": "不就像游戏一样嘛♪\n来，惠美，随便点一首进去！选首你应该知道的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_1009_020meg", "source_sha256": "9c95ecf922b510e883bee7ee2f9559babcb785b2e00c0459d5f2b4937af39286", "ja": "りょーかい！　ん～、なにがいいかな～？\n可愛いのがいい？　それとも……", "zh": "收到～！嗯～选什么好呢～？\n想听可爱的？还是说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_1010_020meg", "source_sha256": "79673d47aabf2564b6bfbbc02462e3f454925db8a1721ab57d1a2e273557563c", "ja": "あ、これにしよっと！\nアタシたちも一緒に歌えるヤツ……っと。", "zh": "啊，就选这个吧！\n选个我们也能一起唱的……好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_1011_se", "source_sha256": "6ec34d440ceb2ba0751fd6735ddd5cecbf1f19c93f04c0d7208bbea677b789f3", "ja": "ピッ！", "zh": "哔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_1012_050jul", "source_sha256": "57eb67f848a483e1259c2a92f217db08db884ee794ca0a3fa004e1a4ab6124b0", "ja": "おっ、いいね♪　ほら{$P$}、\nマイクマイク！　今日のセンター、よろしくな。", "zh": "哦，不错♪ 来，{$P$}，\n麦克风麦克风！今天的中心位，就拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ab861a05f00666711fb446cf73b951a5efd67b61dc12e9d5e79faf6969bdf008", "ja": "あ、えっ！？　う、ううっ……！", "zh": "啊，诶！？呜、呜呜……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_1014", "source_sha256": "51ec779a10ad5b34b77df693fc6081db3d9f6150b8206191378bb36f09850ff1", "ja": "サンキュー！", "zh": "谢谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_2000_p", "source_sha256": "5c1824d75621da60750af946713edb97ea563623809a079e07e2b56d38477ed8", "ja": "さ、サンキュー！", "zh": "谢、谢谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_2001_050jul", "source_sha256": "552c1e401f31f18b54a10549c4048334e92d58982ad93f5e85d4a640bf6ed351", "ja": "いえーいっ♪", "zh": "耶～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_2002_020meg", "source_sha256": "552c1e401f31f18b54a10549c4048334e92d58982ad93f5e85d4a640bf6ed351", "ja": "いえーいっ♪", "zh": "耶～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_2004_050jul", "source_sha256": "3a52806ce81d1cb16d1feb6092e132a5a491b74655f2cc791ea203ff11b62dad", "ja": "ふぅ……やっぱカラオケって楽しいな♪\nボイトレとかライブとかで、いつも歌ってんのにな。", "zh": "呼……卡拉OK果然还是很开心啊♪\n明明平时声乐训练和演唱会什么的，也一直都在唱歌。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_2005_020meg", "source_sha256": "7f170ee12b450ba82b1a9c9866f94ce096c08ad5b5a47df28326384ff93c8b4e", "ja": "ねね、次どこ行く？　アタシ的には、\nやっぱファミレスは外せないかなーって……。", "zh": "喂喂，接下来去哪儿？我觉得吧，家庭餐厅果然还是不能少呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_2006_p", "source_sha256": "c51739250cc53e9d219f494e6a2e648d88bb6eb3a237f148bdc63288db13bbec", "ja": "ごめん、ふたりとも。\nええと……そろそろ仕事に戻りたいんだ。", "zh": "对不起，你们两个。  \n那个……我差不多该回去工作了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_2007_050jul", "source_sha256": "b443b21196af7dcfad4088d945d326b17bef6d78524a1ca749da094ef65c76be", "ja": "……んだよ。\nウチらといるの、あんまり楽しくなかった？", "zh": "……干嘛啦。\n跟我们待在一起，觉得很无聊吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_2008_p", "source_sha256": "534339f5d20e9d7acc7625283c2e22ac309bf0735ee2c56e09e067eba612647e", "ja": "楽しいに決まってるよ。だから心配なんだ。\nこのまま仕事に戻りたくなくなったら困るからな。", "zh": "当然开心了。所以才会担心啊。\n要是就这样不想回去工作了，那可就麻烦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_2009_020meg", "source_sha256": "e03cef768698b1b243a1c28af55b87fc5bc6042bee85878b022065d3764d4a00", "ja": "そういうことなら、しょうがないかな～。\nそろそろ返してあげよっか？　ジュリア。", "zh": "既然是这样，那也没办法啦～。\n差不多该放你回去了吧？　茱莉亚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_2010_050jul", "source_sha256": "95707ebb06d9d9529f00f112c58859cd42e7c25326af974e86629cca97d1ea46", "ja": "ま、頃合いか……。\nんで、どうよ？　ちょっとは息抜きできたか？", "zh": "嗯，时间差不多了吧……\n所以，感觉如何？多少有喘口气放松一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_2011_p", "source_sha256": "c25baa5583f17a0d12100bf6c1dee5a60ece96727bbe855c5e3d6c375809fab2", "ja": "ああ、やっぱり……そういうつもりだったのか。", "zh": "啊，果然……你是打算这么做的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_2012_020meg", "source_sha256": "83e3048ffa51fb00bcebf35d23d21e6f68449f44f801bca4d73b4ea7dc72a88e", "ja": "あ、やっぱりバレてた？", "zh": "啊，果然还是被发现了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_2013_p", "source_sha256": "d5c931aa5842f173739a8232492a0b846b75234503f55684f67eff6fa58c2b82", "ja": "そりゃ、わかるよ。気を遣ってくれてることくらい。\nありがとう、ふたりとも。", "zh": "当然看得出来啊，你们是在替我着想嘛。\n谢谢你们两个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_2014_050jul", "source_sha256": "d2d165d8952254f7e0a5603d5371ac0f0025d38424d58ec48315679fa4b4e105", "ja": "ったく……。\n担当アイドルに、あんまり心配かけんなよな！", "zh": "真是的……\n别让负责的偶像太担心了啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_2015_020meg", "source_sha256": "0218f68aa4a7fa187ebbbb23a8db066de7449e82b36c5d9ebee9d03f65140de8", "ja": "……。ね、{$P$}。\n本当に、このまま逃げちゃう？", "zh": "……我说，{$P$}。\n真的要就这样逃跑吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_2016_p", "source_sha256": "076d55ecaae782f265d4bad557aed6693eae85176dad5da84f81388c7ed0394d", "ja": "……え？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_2017_020meg", "source_sha256": "44417eccfc453019f3f58cea55929febefdabf56de4d0be451742fde7fe459a2", "ja": "アタシたちとさ、全部捨てて、どっか遠くまで。\n……なーんて。けっこう楽しそうじゃん？", "zh": "要不和我们一起，把一切都抛下，去很远的地方。\n……开玩笑的。不过听起来还挺有意思的，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_2018_050jul", "source_sha256": "f46411caaf4d43fd5e2152c213f4c49b491ef4101178f9f2326bd6fb6c237ac1", "ja": "このまま{$P$}の車でか？\nははっ、そりゃロックだな！　どうする？", "zh": "就这样开着{$P$}的车吗？  \n哈哈，那可真摇滚！怎么办？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_2019_p", "source_sha256": "052d33f8e269bd44be198814a9efbe5476cff0da193035f009760029013119d8", "ja": "……ありがとう。でも、それはしないよ。\nすごく楽しそうなお誘いだけど。", "zh": "……谢谢。不过，我不会那样做。\n虽然这邀请听起来确实很有意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_2020_p", "source_sha256": "c96180a4807ba333104a74ae2992ef694fae4ba5339b045125d670e3456d4617", "ja": "仕事から逃げたいと思った事はあっても、\nアイドルから逃げたいと思った事は、一度もないから。", "zh": "虽然也有过想逃离工作的念头，\n但我一次都没有想过要逃离偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0282_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0282_story_05_2021_020meg", "source_sha256": "cdad617a373eba84bebea772b8b9ac37fd0ffe31fc74767d463e56b8ef8d5c8e", "ja": "にゃはは♪　そっか。", "zh": "喵哈哈♪这样啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
